d":"vndb:vn-staff:193769","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"小野 悠輝","creatorId":"vndb:s40921","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s40921","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s40921","name":"小野 悠輝","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:193771","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"渡 航","creatorId":"vndb:s41970","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s41970","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s41970","name":"渡 航","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:193773","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c168137","characterName":"川崎 京華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c168137"},"originalCharacterName":"川崎 京華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8296a9d0496f1822e0b134233979e283924f7c45f45c703695fa52506074d67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c23cbf3b778c3a44ef180b4bc57b335aaf8f98b69a7600fa250e2c28cc05c10.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c168138","characterName":"玉縄","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c168138"},"originalCharacterName":"玉縄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d1f5eac85f7a471110317283c715b9998a6e0d6515408c0f67a6396382f0976.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2ca804d5513fa2769227d4a85f911de7699c585dc091aa9d25d6e1b9be5343f6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23609","characterName":"比企谷 八幡","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23609"},"originalCharacterName":"比企谷 八幡","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"808"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hachiman is the story's main protagonist. Hachiman is a student in class 2F of Soubu High School who is isolated, friendless and pragmatic to a fault. His most prominent feature is his set of \"dead fish-eyes\". He firmly believes that \"youth\" is simply an illusion created by hypocrites, for hypocrites, born from the ashes of past failures. In this state of apparent corruption, he is coerced into joining the Service Club by his futures advisor in the hopes that exposing him to the world will change his personality, and ultimately make him a \"better person\". Hachiman believes that he is insignificant and thus is willing to take on blames in order to keep everyone else happy. He is affectionately called \"Hikki\" by Yui. Hayato's clique wrongly address him as \"Hikitani\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23609"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e2138ef3c87750ac401088ee2949a7311ed10105233da1242ea534bc1d8a793.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c15c13c0a965d7cedb0ad6ccda48724ea6c42e15ed5c327c959db4e3945fec4f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"江口 拓也","creatorId":"vndb:s40","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s40","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s40","name":"江口 拓也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94299","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23610","characterName":"平塚 静","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23610"},"originalCharacterName":"平塚 静","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizuka is Hachiman's teacher, a language teacher who serves as his futures advisor/counselor and the consultant for the service club. She is aware of Hachiman's supposed \"problems\", and takes steps to ensure he is freed from them, her first move being to force him into joining the Service Club. However, she appears to have some quirks of her own: she is a young smoker, she is very sensitive about her age and single status, and she is often prone to quoting or copying scenes from popular shōnen manga. She also never remembers to knock before entering the Service Club's classroom, much to Yukino's chagrin. After the cultural festival incident, she tells Hachiman that helping others should not be a reason for Hachiman to hurt himself, as there are others who would feel pain seeing Hachiman hurt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23610"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce8e620e2b030d5b295c6e1ce7315967a9bb22f9936230790da160d337926097.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b16df136665cf2094f399c127e4e5c345b8cd0f8da6b3e67bf3594204eea06e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚木 涼香","creatorId":"vndb:s495","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s495","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s495","name":"柚木 涼香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94300","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23611","characterName":"比企谷 小町","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23611"},"originalCharacterName":"比企谷 小町","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"303"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Komachi is Hachiman's younger sister who, different from her brother, is cheerful and lively, and is a member of the student council in her school. She understands that her brother has a corrupted personality but still cares for and relies on him regardless. While attached to her brother, she shows cleverness in trying to pair up Hachiman with Yukino or Yui."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23611"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d9b077ce665f2b4e2f46b329d397eba20b1bfab4581a25967b6d5dd3972b7eb9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25f0c624d359e6f0502d805bde244ee9aae70c805163ac1631b7b79fe1bb98ac.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"悠木 碧","creatorId":"vndb:s1321","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1321","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1321","name":"悠木 碧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94303","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23612","characterName":"雪ノ下 雪乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23612"},"originalCharacterName":"雪ノ下 雪乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"103"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukino is a student in class 2J and the leader of the service club, of which she is the sole member until Hachiman joins. She is from a wealthy family, smart, beautiful, and is nicknamed the \"Ice-cold Beauty\" for her icy demeanor. Due to her popularity with boys, she is envied by most girls, and is disgusted by their attitude to undermine her instead of improving themselves, thus she has few friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukino has a twisted sense of \"noblesse oblige\", and believes that it is the duty of the exceptional (in other words, herself) to help the \"lost lambs\" of the world. Her personality often leads her to be disgusted at the naivete of others, particularly Yui's, and she does not hesitate to show it. Despite this, Yui still affectionately refers to her \"Yukinon\". After the first cultural festival, while she still does not recognize Hachiman as a friend, she recognizes him as an acquaintance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23612"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a8023b9980cabe4400f43b51972b0936221bbf3c59a8ff219c741d19f853c32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d5f1ea0ef16d6aebd9cd134f9469c07bfd51f58381e8ee9f1a79e19597c098c7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"早見 沙織","creatorId":"vndb:s1871","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1871","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1871","name":"早見 沙織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94304","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23615","characterName":"由比ヶ浜 結衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23615"},"originalCharacterName":"由比ヶ浜 結衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"618"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yui is Hachiman's classmate. She is a cheerful, outgoing girl who becomes the service club's first \"customer\", asking them to help her bake cookies for \"a certain someone\". Her problems lie not with her personality, but with her inability to express herself due to fear in losing friends, and thus admired Yukino and Hachiman who are able to express their true feelings. She believes that talent is inborn, and often aspired to be like others until Yukino changed her way of thinking. Following her experience with the Service Club, Yui begins to attend Service Club sessions after school as well, despite Yukino's objections early on. In class, Yui is a member of Hayato's clique but has no say in matters as she is often overwhelmed by Yumiko. She has been holding feelings towards Hachiman ever since he saved her dog on their first day of high school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23615"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9044d8d1ede8c602a28ff60d7c2190f50add86f2fa7a14e47a12fd19d4d857a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08a66a801be45dfee7675c2c8c297b7f40cb97127d10335b9221edd7f96807c0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"東山 奈央","creatorId":"vndb:s5716","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5716","name":"東山 奈央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94306","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23623","characterName":"三浦 優美子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23623"},"originalCharacterName":"三浦 優美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1212"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yumiko is a popular girl from class 2F with a pompous personality. She is the main female figure in Hayato's clique. Due to her popularity, she has no trouble making friends and thus has little to no understanding towards people who have social troubles. She brushes off anything she doesn't understand as \"making no sense\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23623"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/413570fb516e138454af3c4ebadb68921190d41ae8fbe48d8c2151aa2bcbf4aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17d6ade08754d750578dec89962b3ad39fb227a3b9820d6763ba1d686508ca3f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23624","characterName":"海老名 姫菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23624"},"originalCharacterName":"海老名 姫菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"714"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hina is a fujoshi from class 2F who is in Hayato's clique. She has a habit of preaching about her hobby whenever she is excited and thus is generally avoided by her male classmates. Hina knows of Kakeru's feelings towards her during the school excursion but does not want to engage in a relationship at the current time due to her lack of confidence, and thus requested help from Hachiman to help maintain the status quo, which Hachiman succeeded in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23624"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f45cd0e6bdabfd34abff5a6023b1b32d9563e786bac52ce94e493565c182d524.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13f110f845eb6be092c73ad938866df7dd69156f8c119d8fa0c7fd105a9be89e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23626","characterName":"戸塚 彩加","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23626"},"originalCharacterName":"戸塚 彩加","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"309"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saika is the president of the tennis club who has a androgynous appearance, but prefers others to not mistake his gender. He is called \"The Prince\" by his female classmates. On their first meeting, Saika asks help from Hachiman to join the tennis club, which was brushed off by Yukino. Saika then asked the service club to help him improve his tennis skills. He eventually became one of the few people in class 2F who would talk to Hachiman on a first name basis, and often hangs out with Hachiman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23626"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74df80b164490f3df2ccd73a858da70780b2faedc8d446110a0b5b5603fca1c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7059c99190f21426fa399ad977ddaac6dc6dba153be2875d118db67778ae7db8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小松 未可子","creatorId":"vndb:s7545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7545","name":"小松 未可子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94307","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23629","characterName":"材木座 義輝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23629"},"originalCharacterName":"材木座 義輝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1123"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yoshiteru is a student from class 2C who suffers from adolescent delusions. He sees Hachiman as a friend after being paired up with him during physical education lessons. While he is annoying, he has a group of otaku friends he's on good terms with. He aims to be a light novel writer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23629"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/535ded1f0cf1cdd53e855425edfbdd99995f89eff05e35ed9f746971890fa25d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfe717a41b504aa6fba04b01953c6ff6c978e960f10c01187a6bce640056ae58.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23636","characterName":"葉山 隼人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23636"},"originalCharacterName":"葉山 隼人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"928"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hayato is Yukino's childhood friend who is a central figure in class 2F and the ace of the football club. He is extremely kind to other people, including Hachiman, and often offers his help to others. However, Hayama claims that he can never forge a good relationship with Hachiman as despite understanding his acts of social suicide to protect everyone, he does not agree with him. He and Yukino have some strain to their relationship, stemming from an incident in the past in which Yukino was being ostracized or bullied, and Hayato failed to protect her. So far his attempts to mend his relationship with Yukino failed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23636"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1baa39bc1c268414e135d72837316ce2d261444f40c3670f552f4c98bf19731a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa7a8a25ea23db8f894b1635d2c0e32e52b326a58d58cb1c3f8db908d4dabfbb.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23639","characterName":"戸部 翔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23639"},"originalCharacterName":"戸部 翔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"829"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kakeru is a member of Hayato's clique. He is in the football club. He has feelings for Hina and is the only guy in class who supported Hina's script for the cultural festival. During the school excursion, he intends to confess to Hina, and therefore requested help from the service club. However, as Hachiman understands Hina's current stance to not be in a relationship, Hachiman thinks that what's broken can't be mend and thus confessed to Hina ahead of Kakeru. Hina's rejection to Hachiman successfully stopped Kakeru from confessing to Hina and thus maintained the status quo."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23639"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a62fd8c7570030ab90e788a5ce3ed2148676afc9a317da442da791f4c4f1a6e6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/776f2410d21d2b639eb9f13d51caa1c69b97d6f05c8e3cbb41dfe893121d8fb2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c23641","characterName":"川崎 沙希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c23641"},"originalCharacterName":"川崎 沙希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1026"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saki is Hachiman's classmate who seems like a delinquent, but wants to make friends deep down. She cares deeply for her brother as she hid her name and age to work in night-shift part-time jobs in order to pay school fees and reduce her family's load. After her brother asked help from the service club, the service club eventually followed her to her workplace and found out her motives behind working night-shifts, she stopped working after the service club suggested her to aim for a scholarship instead."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23641"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/833fe3c620dd4e67032adb3952cf67a4a66a76132891a2ae9bb638eb216f0280.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79f50db9d35929798997d72d0f5a29ca3037a2ca727158739268e74cee9bc867.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小清水 亜美","creatorId":"vndb:s622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s622","name":"小清水 亜美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94301","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38136","characterName":"一色 いろは","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38136"},"originalCharacterName":"一色 いろは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"416"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iroha is a first year student at Sobu High School. She is the club manager of the school's football club. She acts cute in front of everybody, but shows her true colors only in front of Hachiman."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38136"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b6e2a1328fa62d1bbe073e989923ee9732eb9e48803a5b31d2b6e7d0b8f92702.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec7a17e61a1cb36f6e18b9a4c257a77825973e3d6bf65900c534592c47d00567.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉 綾音","creatorId":"vndb:s3892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3892","name":"佐倉 綾音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94305","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c54272","characterName":"折本 かおり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c54272"},"originalCharacterName":"折本 かおり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hachiman's former classmate in middle school whom he confessed to once and got rejected. Currently goes to Kaihin Sougou High School. She is very easily amused and has a habit of saying \"Chou ukeru (that's hilarious)\" and \"Sore aru! (that's it!)\" but despite all this Kaori is smart and observant."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c54272"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e4b06c6bd92d759e91c80ccbd23b8953117f172b3e08663397f5ce5bcbf1102.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f783e1dd5057fd423c25b2538ea828e6995056f93ac383895cde02f11aaede8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"chara